    # REGINA @ talk "When she wants meat, her hunting instincts take over."
    REGINA @ talk "Когда ей нужна плоть, её охотничьи инстинкты берут верх."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:768
